('meetup:zurich-react-evening','React Zurich: Patterns that survive production','React Zurich','Meetup','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '4 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '4 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '3 hours','in_person','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'free','Free',ARRAY['React','TypeScript','Testing']::text[],'https://www.meetup.com/react-zurich/','A hands-on evening on component boundaries, data fetching and the state patterns that hold up once a codebase grows. Bring a laptop; pairs welcome.',6),
('wit:women-in-react-workshop','Women in React: build & deploy your first dashboard','Women Who Code Zurich','Women in Tech Community Calendar','women_program',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '11 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '11 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '4 hours','hybrid','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'free','Free (donations welcome)',ARRAY['React','TypeScript','Accessibility']::text[],'https://www.womenwhocode.com/','Ship something real in one sitting: a filtered dashboard with loading and empty states, reviewed by engineers who do this daily. Beginners genuinely welcome.',14),
('eventbrite:swiss-data-night','Swiss Data Night: SQL to storytelling','Data Community Switzerland','Eventbrite','networking',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '6 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '6 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '3 hours','in_person','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'paid','CHF 25',ARRAY['SQL','Data Visualisation','Stakeholder communication']::text[],'https://www.eventbrite.com/','Two short talks on turning messy operational data into decisions, then long, unhurried mingling with analysts and data leads.',9),
('devpost:femtech-hack','FemTech Hack Europe (48h)','FemTech Collective','Devpost','hackathon',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '19 days' + interval '9 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '19 days' + interval '9 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '48 hours','hybrid','Berlin','DE',52.52,13.405,'free','Free',ARRAY['React','Python','Product thinking']::text[],'https://devpost.com/hackathons','Weekend build sprint on women''s health and care tech. Teams form on site, mentors circulate, and every team demos — a portfolio piece in two days.',21),
('meetup:python-basel','PyBasel: pandas for people who inherited the spreadsheet','PyBasel','Meetup','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '9 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '9 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '2 hours','in_person','Basel','CH',47.5596,7.5886,'free','Free',ARRAY['Python','SQL','Data Visualisation']::text[],'https://www.meetup.com/pybasel/','A practical clinic: load ugly CSVs, clean them, and produce one chart you''d actually show a stakeholder.',4),
('linkedin:cloud-fundamentals-live','Cloud fundamentals live: your first deploy on AWS','Cloud Guild EU','LinkedIn Events','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '3 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '3 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '2 hours','virtual',null,null,null,null,'free','Free',ARRAY['Cloud','Docker','AWS']::text[],'https://www.linkedin.com/events/','From empty account to a running container, narrated slowly. Perfect if cloud has always felt like someone else''s job.',17),
