('meetup:zurich-ml-reading','ML Reading Circle: one paper, plainly explained','Zurich ML Circle','Meetup','networking',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '8 days' + interval '19 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '8 days' + interval '19 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '2 hours','in_person','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'free','Free',ARRAY['Machine Learning','Python','Statistics']::text[],'https://www.meetup.com/','No maths bravado. One recent paper, explained so a careful beginner follows it, then coffee and questions.',5),
('partner:sponsor-office-hours','Sponsor office hours: portfolio reviews with hiring engineers','Hike Copilot Partner Network','Sponsor & Partner Calendar','women_program',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '5 days' + interval '12 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '5 days' + interval '12 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '3 hours','virtual',null,null,null,null,'free','Free for members',ARRAY['Portfolio','Interviewing','React']::text[],'https://ada.example.com/office-hours','Book a 20-minute slot and have an engineer read your repo like a hiring manager would — then tell you the two things to change.',8),
('eventbrite:product-thinking-lab','Product thinking lab for engineers','Product Folks Zurich','Eventbrite','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '14 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '14 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '3 hours','in_person','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'paid','CHF 40',ARRAY['Product thinking','Stakeholder communication']::text[],'https://www.eventbrite.com/','Practise the part of the job nobody teaches: scoping, saying no kindly, and explaining trade-offs to non-engineers.',3),
('meetup:geneva-frontend','Geneva Frontend: accessibility from the first commit','Geneva Frontend','Meetup','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '16 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '16 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '2 hours','in_person','Geneva','CH',46.2044,6.1432,'free','Free',ARRAY['Accessibility','React','Testing']::text[],'https://www.meetup.com/','Screen-reader demos and keyboard-only navigation, then fixing a real component together.',2),
