('linkedin:interview-clinic','Technical interview clinic: think out loud without panic','Careers in Code','LinkedIn Events','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '2 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '2 days' + interval '17 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '2 hours','virtual',null,null,null,null,'free','Free',ARRAY['Interviewing','Algorithms','Communication']::text[],'https://www.linkedin.com/events/','Two mock interviews performed live, including a wrong turn and a recovery — so you see that stumbling is survivable.',19),
('eventbrite:women-in-data-conf','Women in Data Conference','Women in Data EU','Eventbrite','conference',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '33 days' + interval '9 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '33 days' + interval '9 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '8 hours','hybrid','Munich','DE',48.1351,11.582,'paid','EUR 120 (early bird EUR 75)',ARRAY['SQL','Python','Machine Learning','Data Visualisation']::text[],'https://www.eventbrite.com/','Analytics, ML in production, and a candid track on switching into data from another career entirely.',15),
('meetup:docker-k8s-evening','Containers, calmly: Docker and a first Kubernetes deploy','Cloud Native Zurich','Meetup','workshop',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '13 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '13 days' + interval '18 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '3 hours','in_person','Zurich','CH',47.3769,8.5417,'free','Free',ARRAY['Docker','Cloud','DevOps']::text[],'https://www.meetup.com/','Build an image, break it, fix it, deploy it. Ideal before a cloud certification attempt.',6),
