('wit:coffee-pairs-virtual','Virtual coffee pairs: 30 minutes, one new person','Women in Tech CH','Women in Tech Community Calendar','networking',((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '5 days' + interval '8 hours') at time zone 'utc'),((date_trunc('day', (now() at time zone 'utc')) + interval '5 days' + interval '8 hours') at time zone 'utc') + interval '1 hours','virtual',null,null,null,null,'free','Free',ARRAY['Networking','Career change']::text[],'https://www.womenwhocode.com/','You get matched with one woman in tech and a prompt to start from. The lowest-effort way to grow a network.',18),
